vielotus (2.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 2.0.3 (initial upload to Debian; Closes: #1152533):
    - SEN Flex Policy 3B+ mark-only backspace (duocw + Backspace -> được),
      Telex horn propagation (dduwocj -> được, huwou -> hươu), tone-mark
      replacement and expressive vowel repeats (uwfaaa -> ừaaa), double-letter
      and camelCase English preservation (dessert, queue, saveFile), and "pía"
      syllable support.
    - Guard Wayland delete_surrounding_text bounds, harden KDE Plasma 6 Wayland
      virtual keyboard binding and GNOME input-source repair, and update
      Arch/rolling-release Linux CMake build support.
    - Replace legacy hex-encoded array in
      Sources/VieLotusCore/VietnameseSyllableDictionary.swift with plain UTF-8
      source (DFSG #2) and add complete DEP-5 SCOWL attribution to
      debian/copyright.
    - Swift regression suite: 100.00% (9,091/9,091) primary, 97.86%
      (365/373) ambiguous_both_sides, 100.00% (180/180) whitelist_safe=never.

 -- Trần Phát Đạt (Steve Dat) <ttd1232004@gmail.com>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:35:00 +0700

vielotus (2.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 2.0.2:
    - Preserve post-coda circumflex English words (theme vs theem -> them).
    - Align cross-platform code-switching for ee/oo Vietnamese syllables
      in English context (check status treen website -> tren website).
    - Regression suite: 100.00% (9,091/9,091) primary, 97.33% (365/375)
      ambiguous_both_sides, 100.00% (182/182) whitelist_safe=never.
  * Address DFSG NEW review findings from 2.0.1-1:
    - Use mktemp -d (0700) with exit trap in vielotus-settings.
    - Drop redundant Recommends on the vielotus metapackage.
    - Ship /usr/bin/vielotus symlink and manpage alias; update debian/watch
      to Version 5 and keep libvielotus0 strictly Multi-Arch library-only.

 -- Trần Phát Đạt (Steve Dat) <ttd1232004@gmail.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 18:45:00 +0700

vielotus (2.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging preparation for ITP #1152533 (superseded before upload by 2.0.3-1).
  * Official multi-arch (amd64 & arm64) release of Sen Việt (VieLotusIM).
  * Unobfuscated C++20 native engine with canonical UTF-8 (Unicode NFC)
    lexicon wordlists and build-time FNV-1a table generation (DFSG #2).
  * Native Fcitx5 addon (vielotus-telex, vielotus-vni) and IBus engine.
  * Ubuntu Language Support auto-registration for Vietnamese (vi).

